{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43063","headline":"杪秋洞庭怀王道士 · 谢太虚","name":"杪秋洞庭怀王道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漂泊日复日，洞庭今更秋。\n青桃亦何意，此夜催人愁。\n惆怅客中月，裴回江上楼。\n心知楚天远，目送沧波流。\n谢客久已灭，微言无处求。\n空余白云在，客兴随孤舟。\n千里杳难尽，一身常独游。\n故园复何许，江汉徒迟留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谢太虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}